BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:she-got-game-emerging-talents-2026@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T162449Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270901
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270902
SUMMARY:Deadline: Game Design Emerging Talents: She Got Game
DESCRIPTION:She Got Game is a Pro Helvetia mentoring programme promoting eq
 ual opportunities in the Swiss and international game industry\, supportin
 g the representation of women in management positions through dialogue wit
 h experienced international experts from the game industry.\n\nOrganisatio
 n: Pro Helvetia (Swiss Arts Council)\nLocation: Remote/international mento
 ring programme\; applicants must be based in one of Pro Helvetia's liaison
 -office regions (Arab region\, East Asia\, South America\, South Asia and 
 Vietnam\, and West\, Central\, East and Southern Africa).\nAward: CHF 3\,0
 00 toward the production of a prototype or demo version\, plus individual 
 coaching and community access\; potential access to international trade fa
 irs. When attending trade fairs\, applicants with childcare responsibiliti
 es can request up to CHF 250 per week for childcare or children's travel e
 xpenses. No application fee.\nDuration: Six-month mentoring programme\, ap
 proximately 30 hours total commitment\; notification in November 2027\; ea
 rliest project start 1 January 2028. Next application window 1 July to 1 S
 eptember 2027.\n\nMore: https://prohelvetia.ch/en/find-support/game-design
 -emerging-talents-she-got-game-3/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&ut
 m_medium=referral
URL:https://prohelvetia.ch/en/find-support/game-design-emerging-talents-she
 -got-game-3/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Remote/international mentoring programme\; applicants must be base
 d in one of Pro Helvetia's liaison-office regions (Arab region\, East Asia
 \, South America\, South Asia and Vietnam\, and West\, Central\, East and 
 Southern Africa).
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:prohelvetia-game-design-pre-production-2026@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T162449Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270301
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270302
SUMMARY:Deadline: Game Design Emerging Talents: Pre-Production
DESCRIPTION:Pro Helvetia's Game Design Emerging Talents pre-production gran
 t supports early-career game designers in developing playable prototypes f
 or digital games. Emerging Talents are game developers or studios whose ga
 me-design education or company foundation dates back less than seven years
 .\n\nOrganisation: Pro Helvetia (Swiss Arts Council)\nLocation: Switzerlan
 d-based emerging game designers and studios.\nAward: Up to CHF 20\,000\, p
 lus possible additional coaching. No application fee.\nDuration: Pre-produ
 ction / prototype phase\; deadlines twice yearly (1 March and 1 September)
 \; next window opens 1 January 2027 for the 1 March 2027 deadline.\n\nMore
 : https://prohelvetia.ch/en/find-support/game-design-emerging-talents-pre-
 production?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://prohelvetia.ch/en/find-support/game-design-emerging-talents-pre
 -production?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Switzerland-based emerging game designers and studios.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:prohelvetia-game-design-production-2026@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T162449Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270301
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270302
SUMMARY:Deadline: Game Design Emerging Talents: Production
DESCRIPTION:Pro Helvetia's Game Design Emerging Talents production grant fu
 nds the production of digital games based on advanced prototypes or vertic
 al slices. Emerging Talents are studios whose game-design education or com
 pany foundation dates back less than seven years. Applicants must be legal
  entities (sole proprietorships accepted if willing to convert).\n\nOrgani
 sation: Pro Helvetia (Swiss Arts Council)\nLocation: Switzerland-based eme
 rging game studios.\nAward: Up to CHF 50\,000\, requiring a matching grant
  of equal value from own or third-party funding. No application fee.\nDura
 tion: Production phase\; deadlines twice yearly (1 March and 1 September)\
 ; next window opens 1 January 2027 for the 1 March 2027 deadline.\n\nMore:
  https://prohelvetia.ch/en/find-support/game-design-emerging-talents-produ
 ction?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://prohelvetia.ch/en/find-support/game-design-emerging-talents-pro
 duction?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Switzerland-based emerging game studios.
END:VEVENT
