SUMMARY:Deadline: Game Design Emerging Talents: Post-Production
DESCRIPTION:Pro Helvetia's Game Design Emerging Talents post-production gra
 nt funds the dissemination and marketing of advanced game-design projects.
  Emerging Talents are studios whose game-design education or company found
 ation dates back less than seven years. Applicants must be legal entities 
 (sole proprietorships accepted if willing to convert).\n\nOrganisation: Pr
 o Helvetia (Swiss Arts Council)\nLocation: Switzerland-based emerging game
  studios.\nAward: Up to CHF 20\,000\, plus potential individual coaching. 
 No application fee.\nDuration: Post-production\, dissemination and marketi
 ng phase\; deadlines twice yearly (1 March and 1 September)\; next window 
 opens 1 January 2027 for the 1 March 2027 deadline.\n\nMore: https://prohe
 lvetia.ch/en/find-support/game-design-emerging-talents-post-production?utm
 _source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
