SUMMARY:Deadline: Game Design Emerging Talents: She Got Game (Switzerland)
DESCRIPTION:She Got Game is a Pro Helvetia mentoring programme promoting eq
 ual opportunities for women in the Swiss and international game industry\,
  supporting the representation of women in management positions through di
 alogue with experienced international experts.\n\nOrganisation: Pro Helvet
 ia (Swiss Arts Council)\nLocation: Professional game designers from Switze
 rland who identify as women.\nAward: CHF 3\,000 toward prototype/demo prod
 uction\, plus mentoring\, community access\, and potential trade-fair acce
 ss\; up to CHF 250 per week childcare support for international events. No
  application fee.\nDuration: Six-month mentoring programme (approximately 
 30 hours total)\; notification November 2027. Next application window 1 Ju
 ly to 1 September 2027.\n\nMore: https://prohelvetia.ch/en/find-support/ga
 me-design-emerging-talents-she-got-game?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantd
 esk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://prohelvetia.ch/en/find-support/game-design-emerging-talents-she
 -got-game?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Professional game designers from Switzerland who identify as women
 .
