SUMMARY:Deadline 17:00 CET: Creative Europe MEDIA: Innovative Tools and Bus
 iness Models 2027 (EUR 14 million call\, AI\, data and virtual worlds for 
 audiovisual)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 14 Jan 2027 at 17:00 CET.\n\nThe MEDIA strand's Innovati
 ve Tools and Business Models call (CREA-MEDIA-2027-INNOVBUSMOD) funds tool
 s and business models that strengthen the competitiveness of the European 
 audiovisual and video games industries.\n\nOrganisation: Creative Europe M
 EDIA (European Commission / EACEA)\nLocation: EU Member States\, EEA and c
 ountries associated to Creative Europe MEDIA. For organisations (legal ent
 ities) established in a MEDIA country\; natural persons cannot apply.\nAwa
 rd: Total call budget EUR 14\,000\,000\; no fixed cap per project\; 80 per
 cent funding rate. No application fee.\nDuration: Projects normally up to 
 36 months. Call opened 30 September 2026.\n\nMore: https://ec.europa.eu/in
 fo/funding-tenders/opportunities/portal/screen/opportunities/topic-details
 /CREA-MEDIA-2027-INNOVBUSMOD?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_med
 ium=referral
