SUMMARY:Deadline 17:00 CEST: Creative Europe Cross-sectoral: Creative Innov
 ation Lab 2027 (EUR 7.18 million call\, AI\, virtual worlds and data tools
 )
DESCRIPTION:Closes 22 Apr 2027 at 17:00 CEST.\n\nThe Creative Innovation La
 b (call CREA-CROSS-2027-INNOVLAB) funds innovative tools\, models and solu
 tions applicable across the audiovisual and other cultural and creative se
 ctors. Every project must involve the audiovisual sector (video games incl
 uded) plus at least one of music\, books or museums.\n\nOrganisation: Crea
 tive Europe Cross-sectoral strand (European Commission / EACEA)\nLocation:
  EU Member States and countries associated to Creative Europe. For organis
 ations (legal entities) established in an eligible country\; natural perso
 ns cannot apply.\nAward: Total call budget EUR 7\,183\,502\; no fixed cap 
 per project\; actual-cost grant at an 80 percent funding rate. Projects ma
 y re-grant up to EUR 60\,000 per third party. No application fee.\nDuratio
 n: Projects normally up to 24 months. Call opened 22 October 2026.\n\nMore
 : https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportunities/portal/screen/op
 portunities/topic-details/CREA-CROSS-2027-INNOVLAB?utm_source=artificialno
 uveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportunities/portal/screen/o
 pportunities/topic-details/CREA-CROSS-2027-INNOVLAB?utm_source=artificialn
 ouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
